Thought:[32;1m[1;3mFinal Answer:
##### Objective Function:

$\quad \max \sum_{i \in \mathcal{P}} r_i x_i$

where:
- $\mathcal{P}$ is the set of all products,
- $r_i$ is the revenue per unit for product $i$,
- $x_i$ is the number of units of product $i$ to fulfill.

##### Constraints:

For each product $i \in \mathcal{P}$:

$\quad 0 \leq x_i \leq \min\{\text{Demand}_i, \text{InitialInventory}_i\}$

or, equivalently, as two constraints:

$\quad x_i \leq \text{Demand}_i$

$\quad x_i \leq \text{InitialInventory}_i$

$\quad x_i \geq 0$

